    "lesson": 18,
    "title": [
        "How To Be A Vlogger?",
        "如何成为一名视频博主？"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Bob is a boy whose dream is to become a vlogger when he grows up.",
                "鲍勃是一个梦想长大后成为视频博主的男孩。"
            ],
            [
                "He wants to make a variety of interesting videos and share them with people on social media.",
                "他想制作各种有趣的视频，并在社交媒体上与人们分享。"
            ],
            [
                "His parents support him very much.",
                "他的父母非常支持他。"
            ],
            [
                "They bought him a laptop and a printer to encourage him.",
                "他们给他买了一台笔记本电脑和一台打印机来鼓励他。"
            ],
            [
                "They think whether his dream comes true or not, preparing to be a vlogger will be an unusual experience in his life.",
                "他们认为，无论他的梦想是否成真，为成为视频博主做准备都将是他人生中一段不寻常的经历。"
            ],
            [
                "Bob got up early on Sunday to record a video.",
                "鲍勃周日早起录制视频。"
            ],
            [
                "He put the memory card into his digital camera and prepared to record his ideas about some programmes.",
                "他把存储卡放进数码相机，准备录制他对一些节目的想法。"
            ],
            [
                "He started with a self-introduction and discussed some interesting programmes in funny words.",
                "他以自我介绍开始，用有趣的话语讨论了一些有趣的节目。"
            ],
            [
                "After 40 minutes' recording, he pressed the stop button and uploaded the video to the computer.",
                "录制了40分钟后，他按下停止按钮，将视频上传到电脑上。"
            ],
            [
                "Bob downloaded a software to edit the video and add some soft music to it.",
                "鲍勃下载了一个软件来编辑视频，并添加一些轻柔的音乐。"
            ],
            [
                "He didn't mean to show off, but to let people who watch his videos be pleased.",
                "他不是为了炫耀，而是为了让观看他视频的人开心。"
            ],
            [
                "Once he completed editing, he clicked on the mouse and keyboard to visit a website and logged in to upload.",
                "一旦他完成编辑，他就点击鼠标和键盘访问一个网站并登录上传。"
            ],
            [
                "Possibly nobody would like his video at first.",
                "可能一开始没有人会喜欢他的视频。"
            ],
            [
                "It is sad, but Bob knows that being a vlogger is exactly what he wants.",
                "这很令人难过，但鲍勃知道成为一名视频博主正是他想要的。"
            ],
            [
                "There is a voice deep inside his heart telling him to stick to it.",
                "他内心深处有一个声音告诉他要坚持下去。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Never say never.",
                "「永不言弃。"
            ],
            [
                "I don't need to be better than others.",
                "我不需要比别人更好。"
            ],
            [
                "Don't forget that I just want to bring joy to people,\" he said to himself.",
                "别忘了我只是想给人们带来快乐，」他对自己说。"
            ],
            [
                "Suddenly, Bob got a like.",
                "突然，鲍勃收到了一个赞。"
            ],
            [
                "He was very excited.",
                "他非常兴奋。"
            ]
        ]
    },
